<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Rightsizing is about making a choice that supports the life you want to live. By focusing on the benefits and making a plan that works for you, this transition can be an exciting step toward more freedom, less stress, and a home that truly feels like the right fit.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
