<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (The right timing for your move will depend on several factors, including the real estate market, your financial situation, and personal circumstances. Some people choose to rightsize while they are still in good health and able to handle the move easily, while others wait until they feel they need more support.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
