/P 177 0 R
/E (Rightsizing is a major life event, and involving your family in the planning process can provide both emotional and practical support. Your loved ones may be able to help with decision-making, sorting through belongings, and even finding your next home. Open conversations about your goals and expectations can help ensure a smooth transition for everyone involved.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
